      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b>Eastern Ghats (Right / Eastern Edge of the Plateau)</b>

    A discontinuous,
    highly eroded range with an average elevation of about 600 metres.

    Cut by
    rivers flowing into the Bay of Bengal, forming fertile coastal plains.

    Highest
    peak: Mahendragiri (1,501 m) in Odisha.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
