  m_text: <b>The Central Highlands </b>lie to the east of the Aravalli Range and
    are made up of older, eroded plateaus. They include regions like the Malwa Plateau
    and the Chotanagpur Plateau, which are rich in minerals. The rivers here mostly
    flow from southwest to northeast
